==Battleground==
*20 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since this stage is filled with just [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]], using any of the [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark Cats]] will easily clear this stage.

